  "$id": "yakuin-hoshu-input.schema.json",
  "title": "役員報酬シミュレーター入力",
  "description": "入力型設計書 §3〜§7 に基づくWire形式。自動生成物。",
  "$ref": "#/$defs/YakuinHoshuInputWire",
